<title>POLAND: Polish grain, cattle, pork prices rise in 1996.</title>
<headline>Polish grain, cattle, pork prices rise in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement grain, pork, cattle, milk prices rose by between 1.2 and 29.8 percent in 1996 against 1995, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES	     DEC 1996  NOV 1996  DEC 1995</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  57.04     58.50	42.69</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-2.5	-0.9	  7.4</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			33.6	47.2	 29.0</p>
<p>RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  40.53     40.44	25.57</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 0.2	 3.1	  5.8</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			58.5	67.4	 21.8</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.62	2.57	 2.59</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 1.9	-1.2	  1.6</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			 1.2	 0.9	 37.6</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.39	3.47	 2.61</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-2.4	-3.7	 -0.5</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			29.8	32.4	 -1.3</p>
<p>MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.56	0.54	 0.51</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 2.9	 3.0	  3.3</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			10.2	10.7	 38.1</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
